      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "641. 比较下列各式的值和1的大小：",
        "а) $0.01^{1.2}$；　　б) $0.99^{100}$；",
        "в) $\\left(\\frac{13}{12}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{3}}$；　　г) $\\left(\\frac{30}{31}\\right)^{-\\frac{1}{5}}$；",
        "д) $0.007^0$；　　е) $100^{-0.01}$；",
        "ж) $3^{-\\sqrt{2}}$；　　з) $\\left(\\frac{5}{7}\\right)^{\\sqrt{3}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "642",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "642. 已知：",
        "а) $3^x=0.9$，б) $\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)^x=10$，в) $10^x=4$，г) $0.3^x=0.1$，",
        "关于 $x$ 的符号能作出什么结论？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "643",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "643. 解下列方程：",
        "а) $5^x=5^6$；б) $3^x=\\frac{1}{9}$；в) $12^x=1$；",
        "г) $(0.1)^x=1000$；　　д) $\\left(\\frac{1}{8}\\right)^x=64$；",
        "е) $\\left(\\frac{2}{7}\\right)^x=42\\frac{7}{8}$；　　ж) $\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^x=1.5$；",
        "з) $1^x=15$；　　и) $(0.4)^x=6\\frac{1}{4}$；",
        "к) $6^x=6\\sqrt[3]{36}$；　　л) $3^x=\\frac{9}{\\sqrt[3]{9}}$；",
        "м) $0.2^x=\\sqrt{0.008}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "644",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "644. 解下列不等式：",
        "а) $6^x<6^8$；　　б) $0.7^x>0.49$；",
        "в) $2^x<\\frac{1}{64}$；　　г) $0.1^x>100$；"
      ]
    },
